Command
  Opcode  0xFF  RESET
  Ignored  11 bytes  FF FF FF C2 01 C0 03 00 C3 C0 69
    Reset Pattern  Figure 65 draws 16 clocks with every I/O line high; this frame is 96 clocks and has ignored bytes that are not all FFh [!]
  Register Reset  008h-00Bh General Capabilities and Configurations at the chip select deassertion edge; every other register retains its value
Session
  I/O Mode  0x0  Single I/O, from this chip select's deassertion edge
  CRC Checking  0  disabled, from this chip select's deassertion edge
