  Opcode  0x21  GET_CONFIGURATION
  Address  0x0030  Channel 2 Capabilities and Configurations
  CRC  0xB8  ok
TAR  2 clocks
Response
  Response  0x08  ACCEPT
  Data  0x00000111
    OOB Message Channel Maximum Payload Size Selected  0x1  64 bytes
    OOB Message Channel Maximum Payload Size Supported  0x1  64 bytes
    OOB Message Channel Ready  0
    OOB Message Channel Enable  1
  Status  0x010F
    PC_FREE  bit 0 = 1
    NP_FREE  bit 1 = 1
    VWIRE_FREE  bit 2 = 1
    OOB_FREE  bit 3 = 1
    FLASH_C_FREE  bit 8 = 1
  CRC  0xFB  ok
